       , "s 32L(1): after paragraph (c), insert (ca) a specified telecommunication licensee must not appoint an interim judicial manager under section 94(3) of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018 unless it has served 14 days notice in writing on the Authority"
       , "s 32L(2)(a): replace or 211I of the Companies Act with of the Companies Act or section 71 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018"
       , "s 32L(2): after paragraph (b), insert (ba) any meeting convened under section 94(7) of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018 in relation to a specified telecommunication licensee"

