-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:702 | Amendment of Telecommunications Act 1999
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:703 | 22. The Telecommunications Act 1999 is amended —
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:704 | (a) by inserting, immediately after the words “to a company”
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:705 | in the definition of “securities” in section 2, the words
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:706 | “(including a VCC)”;
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:707 | (b) by inserting, immediately after the definition of “Town
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:708 | Council” in section 2, the following definitions:
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:709 | “ “VCC” has the meaning given by section 2(1) of
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:710 | the VCC Act;
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:711 | “VCC Act” means the Variable Capital
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:712 | Companies Act 2018;”; and
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:713 | (c) by deleting the words “and the Trustees Act 1967” in
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:714 | sections 40(7)(a) and 41(7)(a) and substituting in each case
-- src:TA1999.S26-2022:715 | the words “, the Trustees Act 1967 and the VCC Act”.
@ref G.N. No. S 26/2022: the provision that amends the Telecommunications Act (src:TA1999.S26-2022:702-715)
