    CONSIDER act
    WHEN `Act 26 of 2018` THEN `Act 26 of 2018: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 15 of 2019` THEN `Act 15 of 2019: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 40 of 2018` THEN `Act 40 of 2018: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 4 of 2021` THEN `Act 4 of 2021: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 25 of 2021` THEN `Act 25 of 2021: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 12 of 2020` THEN `Act 12 of 2020: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 13 of 2026` THEN `Act 13 of 2026: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `Act 31 of 2022` THEN `Act 31 of 2022: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`
    WHEN `G.N. No. S 26/2022` THEN `G.N. No. S 26/2022: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`

GIVEN act IS AN `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017`
GIVETH A STRING
`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the edition whose section numbers it uses` MEANS
    CONSIDER act
    WHEN `Act 26 of 2018` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 15 of 2019` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 40 of 2018` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 4 of 2021` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 25 of 2021` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 12 of 2020` THEN "2000 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 13 of 2026` THEN "2020 Ed."
    WHEN `Act 31 of 2022` THEN "2020 Ed."
    WHEN `G.N. No. S 26/2022` THEN "2020 Ed."

-- The version rule, as in sgta-ta-versions.l4: an Act's amendment is in operation for a conduct day and a reading day if its effective day is on or before the conduct day AND the day a reader could see it is on or before the reading day.
-- The day a reader could see it is the commencement notification's first-published day for Act 31 of 2022 (S 850/2022), the Order's own for S 26/2022, and for the other seven ASSUMED to be the effective day (their commencement notifications are not deposited).
GIVEN act IS AN `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017`
      `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
        (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` act) AT MOST `conduct day`
    AND (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day a reader could see its date of effect` act) AT MOST `reading day`

GIVEN edition IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF edition EQUALS "2000 Ed." THEN LIST "5", "33", "34", "35", "36", "65", "72", "73"
           IF edition EQUALS "2020 Ed." THEN LIST "5", "53", "54", "55", "56", "85", "95", "96"
           OTHERWISE EMPTY

-- Whole-section test only: s 2 is excluded here because only three of its definitions are on the chain; the s 2 amendments are named in the Act's own list (Acts 4 of 2021 and 12 of 2020 change "owner" and "common property").
GIVEN act IS AN `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN s YIELD elem s (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the edition whose section numbers it uses` act))) (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` act)

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017`
`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN a YIELD `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` a `conduct day` `reading day`)
           (LIST `Act 26 of 2018`, `Act 15 of 2019`, `Act 40 of 2018`, `Act 4 of 2021`, `Act 25 of 2021`, `Act 12 of 2020`, `Act 13 of 2026`, `Act 31 of 2022`, `G.N. No. S 26/2022`)

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The one amended provision on the decisive chain: s 33(7) of the 2000 Edition, s 53(7) of the 2020 Edition.
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1234 | to avoid committing the offence.
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1235 | (7) Where the defence provided by subsection (6) involves an
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1236 | allegation that the commission of the offence was due to the act or
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1237 | default of another person, the person charged shall not, without leave
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1238 | of the court, be entitled to rely on that defence unless, within a period
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1239 | ending 7 clear days before the hearing, he has served on the
-- src:TA1999.20001230:1240 | prosecutor a written notice giving such information identifying or
@ref TA s 33(7) in the 2000 Revised Edition (src:TA1999.20001230:1234-1240)
-- src:TA1999:4875 | (7) Where the defence provided by subsection (6) involves an
-- src:TA1999:4876 | allegation that the commission of the offence was due to the act or
-- src:TA1999:4877 | default of another person, the person charged is not, without
-- src:TA1999:4878 | permission of the court, entitled to rely on that defence unless,
-- src:TA1999:4879 | within a period ending 7 clear days before the hearing, the person
-- src:TA1999:4880 | charged has served on the prosecutor a written notice giving such
-- src:TA1999:4881 | information identifying or assisting in the identification of that other
-- src:TA1999:4882 | person as was then in the possession of the person charged.
@ref TA s 53(7) in the 2026 consolidation (the 2020 Revised Edition as amended) (src:TA1999:4875-4882)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 30 12 2000) THEN NOTHING
           IF `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 25 of 2021` `conduct day` `reading day` THEN JUST "permission"
           OTHERWISE JUST "leave"

-- Two s 2 definitions the other Acts change (neither is "equipment", "radio-communication" or "broadcasting apparatus").
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`TA s 2, definition of "owner": paragraph (b) still names HUDC housing estates, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 4 of 2021` `conduct day` `reading day`)

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A STRING
`TA s 2, definitions of "common property" and "owner" (paragraph (a)(iii)): the name of the strata statute, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 12 of 2020` `conduct day` `reading day` THEN "Building (Strata Management) Act"
           OTHERWISE "Building Maintenance and Strata Management Act"
